msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/"
"REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body><p>With Simon you can create and manage models yourself "
"or you can download and use general models that describe the average speaker "
"of your target language. We call these models \"base models\".</p>\n"
"<p>You can find more information about base models on <a href=\"http://"
"userbase.kde.org/Simon/Base_models\">our wiki</a>.</p></body></html>"
